02:18:00.800 --> 02:18:06.800 align:start position:19%
official record for this meeting. The
reason for this formal objection is

02:18:04.719 --> 02:18:11.040 align:start position:19%
simple. Under article 1, section 4 of
the Wyoming Constitution, the words

02:18:09.120 --> 02:18:16.880 align:start position:19%
determine and discover are a
constitutional non-starter. In Wyoming,

02:18:13.840 --> 02:18:21.519 align:start position:19%
a warrant is a tool to verify a specific
pre-existing suspicion of a violation

02:18:19.040 --> 02:18:25.439 align:start position:19%
that has been documented under oath. It
is not a license for the government to

02:18:23.280 --> 02:18:30.960 align:start position:19%
enter a private home or business to
discover whether a violation exists. In

02:18:28.479 --> 02:18:35.359 align:start position:19%
legal terms, that is an unconstitutional
fishing expedition. My attached

02:18:33.439 --> 02:18:39.359 align:start position:19%
supplement cites the Wyoming Supreme
Court's ruling in Oil versus State,

02:18:37.840 --> 02:18:43.359 align:start position:19%
which makes it clear that our state
constitution provides stronger privacy

02:18:41.679 --> 02:18:47.920 align:start position:19%
protections than the Fourth Amendment.
It prohibits general warrants, the kind

02:18:45.679 --> 02:18:51.599 align:start position:19%
that allow an official to enter for one
reason, and then spend their time

02:18:49.679 --> 02:18:55.679 align:start position:19%
discovering other things to cite you
for. If an inspector does not already

02:18:53.920 --> 02:18:59.439 align:start position:19%
have probable cause that a specific
violation exists, they have no business

02:18:57.599 --> 02:19:04.319 align:start position:19%
asking a judge for a warrant to go
discover one. The strike sheet I

02:19:01.840 --> 02:19:10.639 align:start position:19%
provided shows exactly how to fix this.
It's really, really easy. Remove two

02:19:07.679 --> 02:19:15.439 align:start position:19%
words, determine and discover. Your
authority must be limited strictly to

02:19:12.559 --> 02:19:18.960 align:start position:19%
verifying documented violations. We are
not uneducated on this matter. We know

02:19:17.359 --> 02:19:23.280 align:start position:19%
that when a government official asks for
the power to discover conditions inside

02:19:21.519 --> 02:19:27.439 align:start position:19%
private property, they're asking for a
skeleton key to our front doors. The

02:19:25.519 --> 02:19:31.599 align:start position:19%
government exists to protect our rights,
not to create loopholes to bypass them.

02:19:29.599 --> 02:19:36.240 align:start position:19%
So, I urge you to review the case law I
provided and close this loophole by

02:19:33.679 --> 02:19:39.679 align:start position:19%
removing those two words before a vote
is taken on this ordinance. Thank you.

